<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank allots 12.19 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank allots 12.19 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 12.19 billion schillings in one-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed 3.0 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The central bank said 13 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week, the central bank allotted 14.62 billion schillings, or 16 percent of bids, in repos. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 253</p>
